{
  "mentor_tip": {
    "title": "慢半步",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "师父，刚才那一剑，我明明已经快了，怎么还是收不住？",
        "voice": "opening",
        "next": "sit"
      },
      "sit": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "过来坐。你这口气，还留在剑坪上呢。",
        "voice": "sit",
        "next": "hurry"
      },
      "hurry": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "我就是想早些练好，免得总让您等。",
        "voice": "hurry",
        "next": "advice"
      },
      "advice": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "剑快一点不难。难的是出剑时，心里不抢那一步。",
        "voice": "advice",
        "next": "choice"
      },
      "choice": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "先陪我听一会儿雨。等肩膀松了，再想刚才那一剑。",
        "voice": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "take_lesson",
            "label": "坐下来，随师父调息（精力8 · 1时辰）",
            "next": "lesson_taken",
            "action": "claim_mentor_lesson",
            "conditions": {
              "stats_gte": {
                "energy": 8
              },
              "flags": {
                "mentor_lesson_accepted": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "return_to_practice",
            "label": "先回去自己试试",
            "next": "lesson_skipped",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {}
          }
        ]
      },
      "lesson_taken": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "好，我不抢。先把这一口气放稳。",
        "voice": "lesson_taken",
        "next": "lesson_reply"
      },
      "lesson_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "这就对了。待会儿再出剑，记住此刻肩上的轻松。",
        "voice": "lesson_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "lesson_skipped": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "那我先去试试。要是还不对，我再来找您。",
        "voice": "lesson_skipped",
        "next": "skip_reply"
      },
      "skip_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "去吧。慢半步，也无妨。",
        "voice": "skip_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "end": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "这番话先记在心里。下一次修习，看看剑势是否更稳。",
        "set_flags": {
          "mentor_lesson_heard": true
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "mentor_practice_report": {
    "title": "练剑回报",
    "start": "report_question",
    "nodes": {
      "report_question": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "方才那套剑，练得如何？",
        "voice": "report_question",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "with_lesson",
            "label": "说说调息后的体会",
            "next": "report_calm",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "mentor_lesson_accepted": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "self_practice",
            "label": "说说自己试剑的体会",
            "next": "report_try",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "mentor_lesson_accepted": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "later",
            "label": "稍后再向师父回报",
            "next": "laterend",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {}
          }
        ]
      },
      "report_calm": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "这回我没急着抢那一步，剑也收稳了。",
        "voice": "report_calm",
        "next": "report_calm_reply"
      },
      "report_calm_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "嗯，先记住这份从容。明日再练，不必把今天的力气都用尽。",
        "voice": "report_calm_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "report_try": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "刚才还是有些急，不过我知道该从哪儿改了。",
        "voice": "report_try",
        "next": "report_try_reply"
      },
      "report_try_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "知道哪里急，就有了进步。先歇歇，明日再来。",
        "voice": "report_try_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "end": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "今日听教与练剑已记下，歇息后仍可继续修行。",
        "set_flags": {
          "mentor_reported": true
        }
      },
      "laterend": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "今日练剑已记录，稍后仍可回廊复命。"
      }
    }
  },
  "dock_keeper_talk": {
    "title": "茶商 · 壶边闲话",
    "start": "ask",
    "nodes": {
      "ask": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "dock_tea_keeper",
        "text": "歇脚，还是看船？石阶上慢些，别踩湿了。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "ask_boat",
            "label": "问问这条船",
            "next": "boat",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "ask_tea",
            "label": "看看茶棚",
            "next": "tea",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "leave_keeper",
            "label": "先四处走走",
            "next": "end",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {}
          }
        ]
      },
      "boat": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "dock_tea_keeper",
        "text": "船还系着。看景去石阶上，投石时离船远些。",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "tea": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "dock_tea_keeper",
        "text": "茶壶在篷下，别碰壶口。柳树那头背阴，想歇脚就去那边。",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "end": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "你向茶商点点头，继续在岸边走走。",
        "set_flags": {
          "dock_keeper_met": true
        }
      }
    }
  },
